<!-- qPCR — curva sigmoidea, leyenda y pasos sincronizados con la animación -->
<div class="wrapper">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 280 160" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Animación qPCR">
    <!-- Grid lines -->
    {[40, 80, 120].map(y => (
      <line x1="40" y1={y} x2="260" y2={y} stroke="#1e3a5f" stroke-width="0.5" />
    ))}
    {[80, 120, 160, 200, 240].map(x => (
      <line x1={x} y1="20" x2={x} y2="140" stroke="#1e3a5f" stroke-width="0.5" />
    ))}

    <!-- Threshold line -->
    <line x1="40" y1="72" x2="260" y2="72" stroke="#ffb300" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3" opacity="0.7" />
    <text x="262" y="75" fill="#ffb300" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" opacity="0.9">Ct</text>

    <!-- Amplification curve (sigmoidal) — draws during phase 2 -->
    <path
      d="M 45,135 C 60,134 75,133 90,132 C 105,131 115,128 125,118 C 135,108 140,90 148,78 C 156,66 162,42 175,30 C 185,22 195,20 210,19 C 225,18 240,18 255,18"
      stroke="#00e5ff"
      stroke-width="2.5"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      fill="none"
      class="curve-path"
    />

    <!-- Ct vertical marker — fades in during phase 3 -->
    <line x1="148" y1="72" x2="148" y2="140" stroke="#ffb300" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 2" class="ct-fade" />
    <text x="144" y="150" fill="#ffb300" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" class="ct-fade">~Ct 30</text>
    <circle cx="148" cy="72" r="4" fill="#ffb300" class="ct-fade" />

    <!-- Axes -->
    <line x1="40" y1="20" x2="40" y2="140" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <line x1="40" y1="140" x2="260" y2="140" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <text x="130" y="154" fill="#64748b" font-size="8" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle">Ciclos (1–40)</text>
    <text x="14" y="85" fill="#64748b" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90, 14, 85)">Fluorescencia</text>

    <!-- Technique badge -->
    <rect x="196" y="6" width="58" height="14" rx="4" fill="rgba(0,229,255,0.1)" stroke="rgba(0,229,255,0.4)" stroke-width="0.8" />
    <text x="225" y="16" fill="#00e5ff" font-size="7.5" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">qPCR</text>
  </svg>

  <!-- Leyenda estática -->
  <div class="legend">
    <span class="leg"><span class="lbar" style="background:#00e5ff"></span>curva = fluorescencia acumulada</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="ldash" style="border-color:#ffb300"></span>umbral = nivel de detección Ct</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="ldot" style="background:#ffb300"></span>punto = valor Ct diagnóstico</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Pasos sincronizados con la animación (loop 9s) -->
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step s1">
      <span class="snum">1/3</span>
      <p>ADN molde añadido al tubo. La polimerasa copia el fragmento diana en cada ciclo, unida a una sonda fluorescente que emite luz al amplificar.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step s2">
      <span class="snum">2/3</span>
      <p>La señal fluorescente crece exponencialmente ciclo a ciclo. La curva sigmoide aparece: fase lag → exponencial → plateau.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step s3">
      <span class="snum">3/3</span>
      <p>El <strong>Ct</strong> es el ciclo donde la señal cruza el umbral. Menos molde inicial → Ct más alto. Permite cuantificar copias de ctDNA.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .wrapper { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
  svg { width: 100%; }

  .legend {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 10px;
    padding: 4px 7px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .leg { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
  .lbar { display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 2px; border-radius: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .ldash { display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 0; border-top: 2px dashed; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .ldot { display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }

  .steps { position: relative; height: 5rem; }
  .step {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px;
    padding: 5px 7px;
    background: rgba(0,229,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,0.12);
    border-radius: 5px;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .snum {
    font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.58rem;
    color: var(--accent-cyan); flex-shrink: 0;
    font-weight: bold; padding-top: 1px;
  }
  .step p { font-size: 0.62rem; line-height: 1.42; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0; }
  .step strong { color: var(--accent-amber); font-weight: 600; }

  /* SVG — 9s loop, 3 fases de 3s */
  .curve-path {
    stroke-dasharray: 400; stroke-dashoffset: 400;
    animation: qpcr-curve 9s ease infinite;
  }
  .ct-fade { animation: qpcr-ct 9s ease infinite; }

  @keyframes qpcr-curve {
    0%      { stroke-dashoffset: 400; }
    33.33%  { stroke-dashoffset: 400; }
    63%     { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    96%     { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    100%    { stroke-dashoffset: 400; }
  }
  @keyframes qpcr-ct {
    0%      { opacity: 0; }
    66.66%  { opacity: 0; }
    72%     { opacity: 1; }
    96%     { opacity: 1; }
    100%    { opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* Pasos de texto — 9s loop */
  @keyframes s1 {
    0%      { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    3%      { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    29%     { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    33.33%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
    100%    { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes s2 {
    0%      { opacity: 0; }
    33.33%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    37%     { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    62%     { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    66.66%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
    100%    { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes s3 {
    0%      { opacity: 0; }
    66.66%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    70%     { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    96%     { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    100%    { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
  }
  .s1 { animation: s1 9s ease infinite; }
  .s2 { animation: s2 9s ease infinite; }
  .s3 { animation: s3 9s ease infinite; }
</style>
